                                    v
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                 Orchestration Plane Node (Rust / Tokio)               |
|                                                                       |
|   +-----------------------+         +-----------------------------+   |
|   |  Actor Mailbox Engine | <=====> |  WASM Execution Sandbox     |   |
|   |  (Tokio mpsc Channel) |         |  (Wasmtime + Gas Metering)  |   |
|   +-----------------------+         +-----------------------------+   |
|               ^                                   ^                   |
